Hey  [Music]  our serious note to self focuses today  on supermodel Gisele Bundchen and her  new book lessons right path to a  meaningful life she talks about the  highs and lows of her journey to  becoming a supermodel wife and mother in  this note to her younger self she  reflects on life love and family in a  career that hasn't been as glamorous as  it may appear  bearsy you are 13 on a bus from your  small town to visit the big city of san  paulo for the first time  little do you know that your life would  change forever  to your surprise a model scout  approaches you because of a unique look  [Music]  it turns out the bullies at school who  tease you for being different are wrong  you won't forget being called names like  Olive Oyl by your classmates but you  will forgive them when you turn 16 you  moved to New York without speaking  English he won't be easy in the  beginning jobs are scarce and you have  to learn how to manage your money so you  can have enough to eat but you remain  steadfast and grateful don't worry  in time your hard work discipline and  focus will pay off growing up is a  middle child of six sisters you learn  quickly how to share how to honor each  other's differences and how to work as a  team and this will help you through your  journey  [Music]  you will achieve great success and with  it more pressure jealousy and judgment  will come leaving you feeling sad and  alone then a tiny dog will enter your  life she will make you feel loved and  give you strength you will name her vida  life and that is where she will be your  best friend and constant companion  through all the ups and downs the high  demands from your work schedule  constantly traveling coupled with your  desire to please everyone contribute to  you starting to have panic attacks you  will learn that by saying as to everyone  all the time you're actually saying no  to you and the people's opinions of you  often have nothing to do with you but  mostly should do with how they feel  about themselves and their own  insecurities drop the guilt relax it is  not your responsibility to please  everyone and fix everything  slow down breathe trust your intuition  and remember it's about giving and  receiving since you were little you knew  there was a higher power  we're time you will learn how to listen  to the voice within  it will also experience a deep  connection to nature and protecting her  will become a huge part of your life our  very existence depends on the health of  our planet when we healed the earth we  also heal ourselves your curiosity will  make you want to go deeper and learn  more about yourself through meditation  you'll find a quiet place you can go to  that is within you you will fall in love  get married and fulfill your dream of  being a mother funny baby girl your kids  will expand your heart in ways you never  thought possible and everyday you will  learn and grow with them you will make  mistakes this is all part of growing and  learning so don't be so hard on yourself  you don't have to be perfect you are  exactly how you're meant to be you are  enough so remember no matter what comes  your way keep living your life with love  loving yourself loving others and loving  the world you live in  keep dancing to the beat of your own  drum keep following your heart and don't  apologize  [Music]  you know what's so great about Gisele is  I follow her on Instagram so I feel like  I know she's very family-oriented area  much always see pictures of her with her  sisters her mom I don't read Portuguese  but I'm sure she's saying loving things  to them yeah it just reminds you that  some people can move on and become these  superstars but they don't forget where  they come exactly I like to when she  says saying yes to everyone means saying  no to yourself trust your English  intuition and put yourself first I also  like saying as gorgeous as she is she  has the same kind of issues and  insecurities that that everybody else  has that she's sharing with everybody  she's terrific that makes a wonderful  mom - yeah

